    "topicLabel": "Numerical Reasoning",
    "difficulty": "medium",
    "question": "It costs Rs.50 to make 7 envelopes. If the envelopes are sold at Rs.8 each, what is the profit that is made on each envelope?",
    "options": [
      "Rs.0.77",
      "Rs.0.84",
      "Rs.0.86",
      "Rs.0.88"
    ],
    "answerIndex": 2,
    "explanation": "Total profit = 7×8-50 = 56-50 = Rs.6; Profit per envelope = 6÷7 ≈ Rs.0.86.",
